	<Notes>
		^xFFFF77^xE05030^7Swap to the endgame PoB after completing campaign: ^7^7^7https://pobb.in/h-si3kweTn_N

^xE05030!!!important!!!!^7
^xD02090^7The brackets implies what lvl the skill gem requires. You only need to buy gems if I list them, the rest are from quest rewards. All the gems are also color coded to their respective attribute
Make sure your accuracy is always higher then your life, or else you&apos;ll be missing 40% more damage from ^x70FF70precise technique^7. Check your accuracy by hitting C in game

You need 26 total respec points to properly swap into KB. You&apos;ll get 20~ from campaign and the rest will be gold (roughly 4-6k gold, depending on your lvl).
It&apos;s totally fine to do your early map prog (white and maybe some yellows) to buildup your gear/gold before swapping, but if you&apos;re prepared than swapping when you enter maps is viable.

^xFFFF77Gear:^7
^xFFFF77^7For your bow focus on the highest dps bow you can find, use anger/wrath/hatred essence on good bow bases. The best bow in the campaign is the &quot;Royal bow&quot;. But any bow with high attack speed will work.
Quiver is the same deal, ideally use any woe essence on your quivers to roll bow damage, then flat dmg/attack speed are the next best stats.
Everyother gear piece is just life/resist and make sure your boots have movement speed. After act 5 you should craft resist on all of your pieces so you have good resistance for act 6-10(Use transmutes, don&apos;t waste your alchemy orbs).^7
Ideally don&apos;t have life on your chest so you can use the life mastery for 15% max life mastery. this isn&apos;t that important, but it&apos;s nice to have.
^7^xFFFF77
Regex for vendor:^7 Paste this into the armour vendor. It&apos;ll show 3 links of colors you want, movement speed boots and any quiver.
(\w\W){5}|-\w-.-|(-\w){4}|(-\w){5}|g-g-|-g-g|g-.-g|Runn|rint|Frostblink|niper|thu|^ang|zy$|^has|quiver|g-g

